    .aaRrrrCCc.t..
    ..nnnnnnnc.t..
    ...RrrrCC..t..
    ...RrrCCc..t..
    ...rrrCCc..t..
    ...sssss...t..
    ...ss.ss...t..
    ...ss.ss...t..
    ...kk.kk...t..
    ..kkk.kkk..t..
  end
end

# villager: hooded, 10x18, holds a lantern on the lit side
part villager x y
