# gravestone: thin slab along gx (3 overlapping boxes), carved cross on the lit face
part grave x y
  draw run ($x-2) ($y+5) 3 1 11 stone 8 stone.4
  vline ($x-3) ($y+1) 6 stone.1
  hline ($x-4) ($y+2) 3 stone.1
  px ($x-2) ($y+3) stone.1
end
